TITLE Equilibrium oxidation of pyrite in pure water, fixed O2, allow goethite+gypsum
SOLUTION 1 Pure water initial
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite  0     0.1
    Goethite 0    0
    Gypsum  0     0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -totals S(6)
END
